sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant UI as client_app Pages (register/login)
    participant NM as Network Monitor (fetch interceptor)
    participant AUTH as auth.js Utilities
    participant API as Flask Server
    participant DB as SQLite DB

    U->>UI: Enter server URL, username, password

    rect rgb(245,245,245)
    Note over UI,API: Registration Flow
    UI->>NM: fetch GET /get-parameters
    NM->>API: GET /get-parameters
    API-->>NM: 200 {P,G}
    NM-->>UI: Response logged and returned
    UI->>AUTH: derivePasswordX(username,password)
    AUTH-->>UI: password_x
    UI->>UI: Compute secret_y = g^x mod p
    UI->>NM: fetch POST /register {client_id, secret_y}
    NM->>API: POST /register
    API->>DB: Insert or update user(client_id, secret_y)
    DB-->>API: OK
    API-->>NM: 201 Created or 200 Updated
    NM-->>UI: Response logged and returned
    UI-->>U: Registration success/error message
    end

    rect rgb(235,245,255)
    Note over UI,API: Login (Schnorr) Flow
    UI->>NM: fetch GET /get-parameters
    NM->>API: GET /get-parameters
    API-->>NM: 200 {P,G}
    NM-->>UI: Response logged and returned

    UI->>AUTH: derivePasswordX(username,password)
    AUTH-->>UI: password_x
    UI->>UI: Generate random r and t = g^r mod p

    UI->>NM: fetch POST /login/commit {client_id, commitment_t=t}
    NM->>API: POST /login/commit
    API->>DB: Validate user exists
    DB-->>API: User record
    API->>API: Store commitment and challenge in memory
    API-->>NM: 200 {challenge_c}
    NM-->>UI: Response logged and returned

    UI->>UI: Compute s = (r + c*x) mod q
    UI->>NM: fetch POST /login/verify {client_id, solution_s=s}
    NM->>API: POST /login/verify
    API->>DB: Read user secret_y
    DB-->>API: secret_y
    API->>API: Verify g^s == t * y^c (mod p)
    alt Verification success
        API->>DB: Create/update AuthToken (JWT)
        DB-->>API: Token stored
        API-->>NM: 200 {token, client_id}
        NM-->>UI: Response logged and returned
        UI-->>U: Show auth success + token
    else Verification failure
        API-->>NM: 401 {reason}
        NM-->>UI: Response logged and returned
        UI-->>U: Show error
    end
    end

    rect rgb(245,255,245)
    Note over UI,API: Authenticated Data Flow
    UI->>NM: fetch GET/POST/PUT /data with Authorization token
    NM->>API: /data request
    API->>API: Decode and validate JWT
    API->>DB: Read or write personal data
    DB-->>API: Data result
    API-->>NM: 200/201 or error
    NM-->>UI: Response logged and returned
    UI-->>U: Display result
    end

    Note over API: after_request adds REST/security headers to every response

%% High-level register phase (Client_App/Extension <-> Server)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client_App/Extension
    participant S as Server

    C->>S: GET /get-parameters
    S-->>C: 200 {P, G}

    Note over C: Derive x = hash(password) mod q
    Note over C: Compute secret_y = G^x mod P
    C->>S: POST /register {client_id, secret_y}

    alt New client_id
        S-->>C: 201 {client_id}
    else Existing client_id
        S-->>C: 200 {client_id} (public value updated)
    else Invalid payload or subgroup value
        S-->>C: 400/422 {reason}
    end

    Note over S: Each response includes tracing and security headers
